# The TC39 proposal the corpus's `proposal:intl-era-monthcode@...` provenance names (corpus revision 24, milestone
# SJL-10.2).
#
# Every `proposal:intl-era-monthcode@5833eae#<clause-id>` entry is a clause or table of the Intl era and month code
# proposal's specification text at its Stage 4 draft of 19 March 2026, the revision SJL-8.1 and SJL-10.1 read and
# both engines' calendars follow (its Table 1 of calendar types, Table 2 of eras, Table 3 of month codes and Table 6
# of Chinese and Korean reference years). The Temporal area's calendar vectors cite it beside temporal.pin.
#
# The corpus archives no copy and quotes no text of it. It was read from a clone taken on 2026-10-18 at SJL-10.1:
#
#   git -C <proposal-intl-era-monthcode> show 5833eae6c9079ffbb06a9ab7cc5128ebbf6e9ac7:spec.emu | sha256sum

